      "http_status": 200,
      "body": {
        "status": "success",
        "answer": "**检索条件**：query = `bibcode:2007A&A...474..653V`；范围 database:astronomy；sort = relevance；本页 1 条，total_found = 1。\n\n**书目信息**\n- 标题：Validation of the new Hipparcos reduction\n- 作者：van Leeuwen, F.\n- 年份：2007\n- 期刊：Astronomy and Astrophysics\n- Bibcode：2007A&A...474..653V\n- DOI：10.1051/0004-6361:20078357；10.48550/arXiv.0708.1752\n- 被引次数：3431（查询时记录，不代表论文质量）\n- 链接：https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2007A%26A...474..653V/abstract\n\n**摘要要点（根据摘要）**：该文检验了新版依巴谷（Hipparcos）天体测量数据归算的质量，包括形式误差的一致性与误差相关性；通过内部误差追踪、与少量恒星射电观测对比以及负视差分布来评估外部误差。结论认为新星表视差形式误差得到确认，总权重比 1997 年版提高约 2.2 倍，对恒星光度与本地银河系运动学研究有显著改进。摘要未截断，作者列表未截断。\n\n**来源**：ADS（Astronomy database），检索页 https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/search/q=bibcode%3A2007A%26A...474..653V&fq=database%3Aastronomy&sort=score%20desc&start=0&p_=0 ，检索时间 2026-10-26T12:18:33Z。",
        "results": [],
        "literature_results": [
          {
            "query": "bibcode:2007A&A...474..653V",
            "filters": [
              "database:astronomy"
            ],
            "rows": 5,
            "start": 0,
            "sort": "relevance",
            "status": "success",
            "total_found": 1,
            "returned_count": 1,
            "has_more": false,
            "papers": [
              {
                "bibcode": "2007A&A...474..653V",
                "title": "Validation of the new Hipparcos reduction",
                "authors": [
                  "van Leeuwen, F."
                ],
                "year": 2007,
                "publication": "Astronomy and Astrophysics",
                "doi": [
                  "10.1051/0004-6361:20078357",
                  "10.48550/arXiv.0708.1752"
                ],
                "abstract": "Context: A new reduction of the astrometric data as produced by the Hipparcos mission has been published, claiming accuracies for nearly all stars brighter than magnitude Hp=8 to be better, by up to a factor 4, than in the original catalogue. <BR />Aims: The new Hipparcos astrometric catalogue is checked for the quality of the data and the consistency of the formal errors as well as the possible presence of error correlations. The differences with the earlier publication are explained. <BR />Methods: The internal errors are followed through the reduction process, and the external errors are investigated on the basis of a comparison with radio observations of a small selection of stars, and the distribution of negative parallaxes. Error correlation levels are investigated and the reduction by more than a factor 10 as obtained in the new catalogue is explained. <BR />Results: The formal errors on the parallaxes for the new catalogue are confirmed. The presence of a small amount of additional noise, though unlikely, cannot be ruled out. <BR />Conclusions: The new reduction of the Hipparcos astrometric data provides an improvement by a factor 2.2 in the total weight compared to the catalogue published in 1997, and provides much improved data for a wide range of studies on stellar luminosities and local galactic kinematics.",
